{"said":"aura-2-hyperion-en\nIf you want a local language model or embeddings in Java, there are options. They work, though they're often slower than they should be. [pause] But what if you want to isolate the vocals from a track? Generate product shots for a catalogue? Turn a storyboard into footage? Or any of a plethora of other capabilities? [pause] Until now, from the JVM, you were stuck. It meant a Python stack, or a tool like Comfy U.I. behind HTTP: another runtime, another process, and a network hop on every call. Kiln calls the native engines directly. No Python, no server, nothing in between.","words":[{"word":"if","start":0.32,"end":0.56},{"word":"you","start":0.56,"end":0.71999997},{"word":"want","start":0.71999997,"end":0.88},{"word":"a","start":0.88,"end":1.04},{"word":"local","start":1.04,"end":1.28},{"word":"language","start":1.28,"end":1.5999999},{"word":"model","start":1.5999999,"end":1.92},{"word":"or","start":1.92,"end":2.1599998},{"word":"embeddings","start":2.1599998,"end":2.6399999},{"word":"in","start":2.6399999,"end":2.8},{"word":"java","start":2.8,"end":3.1999998},{"word":"there","start":3.1999998,"end":3.36},{"word":"are","start":3.36,"end":3.52},{"word":"options","start":3.52,"end":4.24},{"word":"they","start":4.64,"end":4.88},{"word":"work","start":4.88,"end":5.52},{"word":"though","start":5.7599998,"end":5.92},{"word":"they're","start":5.92,"end":6.16},{"word":"often","start":6.16,"end":6.3999996},{"word":"slower","start":6.3999996,"end":6.7999997},{"word":"than","start":6.7999997,"end":7.04},{"word":"they","start":7.04,"end":7.2},{"word":"should","start":7.2,"end":7.44},{"word":"be","start":7.44,"end":8},{"word":"but","start":8.72,"end":8.96},{"word":"what","start":8.96,"end":9.12},{"word":"if","start":9.12,"end":9.28},{"word":"you","start":9.28,"end":9.36},{"word":"want","start":9.36,"end":9.5199995},{"word":"to","start":9.5199995,"end":9.599999},{"word":"isolate","start":9.599999,"end":10},{"word":"the","start":10,"end":10.16},{"word"